21	 *
22	 * ── WHY THE SOURCE IS STRIPPED OF COMMENTS FIRST ─────────────────────────────
23	 * This codebase documents its incidents in the code, at length. A tripwire that
24	 * greps raw source for `assertNotImpersonating` matches the comment explaining
25	 * why the guard matters — so it passes on a function whose guard was deleted and
26	 * whose comment survived, which is the exact edit a careless refactor makes.
