/**
 * Website Builder — customer server actions.
 *
 * EVERY export here is a public network endpoint (a `"use server"` module), so
 * every function calls `requireUser()` and proves ownership of the Site by
 * `userId` before touching it — a customer must never read, edit, publish, or
 * delete another customer's site. The heavy lifting (rendering + writing the
 * bundle to nginx) happens in the worker (worker/site-publish.ts) behind the
 * SITE_PUBLISH / SITE_UNPUBLISH jobs; this file only validates, persists drafts,
 * and enqueues.
 */
